What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/.../irq_level
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        LunarProject <199255379+moe-takasaki@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
                Read-only current logical level (0 or 1) of the courbet
                fingerprint sensor IRQ GPIO. Also reachable through
                /sys/class/misc/courbet-fpc/device/irq_level.

                A queued /dev/courbet-fpc edge notification does not imply
                that the line is still asserted. After consuming pending
                notifications, check this level before polling for a new
                event. Recheck after wakeup. Reading does not change power,
                acknowledge the sensor, or consume character-device events.
